## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Flutter SDK
- Dart SDK
- Visual Studio Code or Android Studio
- Chrome or an Android emulator

### Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/anusha123953/DECISIO.git
```

Navigate into the project:

```bash
cd DECISIO
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
flutter pub get
```

Run the application in Chrome:

```bash
flutter run -d chrome
```

Run tests:

```bash
flutter test
```

Analyze the project:

```bash
flutter analyze
```

